# YouTube cookies file (Netscape format)
#
# How to get:
# 1. Install a browser extension like "Get cookies.txt" (or "cookies.txt export")
# 2. Log into YouTube in your browser
# 3. Export cookies in Netscape format
# 4. Save as "cookies.txt" in this project root
#
# This file is REQUIRED. YouTube blocks downloads without a logged-in session.
#
# Example format (do NOT use these fake values):
# .youtube.com	TRUE	/	TRUE	0	GPS	1
# .youtube.com	TRUE	/	TRUE	0	VISITOR_INFO1_LIVE	abc123
# .youtube.com	TRUE	/	TRUE	0	LOGIN_INFO	AFmmF2swRQI...
